\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces End-to-end framework of the hybrid classical-quantum model for multi-label Bengali emotion classification. The dashed classical path corresponds to traditional pipelines, where the compressed text representation is fed directly to the classifier without any quantum component; it is shown for reference and is not a branch in our model. The solid quantum path inserts the variational quantum circuit between the compressed text representation and the post-quantum fusion layer, replacing the direct classical connection in the proposed framework.}}{6}{}\protected@file@percent }
